olve these mechanisms in the existing development handoff, not by assuming safety or permanently refusing food-use development.\\\",\\\"specification\\\":\\\"Implement a Moss-bound extension using the private report and evidence-limit machinery of bounded-unfamiliar-food-assessment, with reuse recorded in implementation provenance; bounded-hazelnut-food-assessment supplies an existing example of exact-source rebinding, not apple food evidence. Study costs 1 active round and 0.2 energy; no mastery is granted by this review. Assess(specimenId=item-261-moss-1554,evidenceRefs=[]), after study, costs 1 atomic active round and 0.2 energy, with no tools, consumables, placement or reservation. Require living Moss, actual local access to the owned unreserved apple, matching origin and harvest identity, and sufficient current energy. Accept at most 8 exact complete personally held evidence keys. Incomplete, unavailable and unrelated references remain explicitly unavailable; do not reconstruct the paged records in this packet or read other actors' knowledge. Failed physical or ownership checks precede payment. Assessment gently views/reorients only and produces an append-only private dated report: exact specimen/source identity, executed method, current supported exterior observation, exact evidence citations and their scope, unresolved identification/edible portions/preparation/ingestion hazards, and supported next-action prerequisites. The existing apple model supports rendered color only; source label, maturity, gathering, exterior appearance, decay bookkeeping and existence of eat do not establish safety, nutrition or absence of toxins. Do not expose hidden chemistry or turn decay metadata into a symptom. Assessment leaves quantityTenths=10, identity, ownership, position and condition unchanged except ordinary world ageing. It neither consumes nor authorizes ingestion.\\\\nProvide QuoteTrial(assessmentId) as a non-physical read of retained findings and executable contracts, costing no simulation round or energy and yielding no experience. In the current development handoff inspect the complete existing eat and probe implementations and related consumption/evidence machinery before adding any missing code. Record exact reused capability IDs and implementation versions. A non-null quote requires a genuinely supported apple/source-applicable consumption and response model, supported portion selection and conservation, and personal applicability; existing personal safety experience is not mandatory for a disclosed uncertain trial, but appearance alone is insufficient support. Its immutable fields must specify exact specimen/revision, preparation and tools if required, dose in supported inventory units, energy/time/material costs, supported nutrition and possible adverse effects with their timing, observation window, stopping rules, dependencies and authorization boundary. Do not invent a dose, nutrient yield, toxin profile or safe waiting interval from this packet. If these are not yet executable, return quote=null and precise missing mechanisms, with remaining development work retained in the current handoff. The assessment precursor remains usable; no trial-success event is possible. Missing mechanisms are development tasks, not a permanent prohibition or an invented multistage activity roadmap.\\\\nOnly expose BeginTrial(quoteId,explicitAuthorization) when a complete executable quote exists. Neither this request, studying, assessing nor quoting supplies that authorization. Revalidate current health, energy, ownership, reach, specimen condition and all quoted physical prerequisites before charging; changed inputs require a new quote. Use the smallest portion the actual supported consumption model permits, never rounding down to zero or silently consuming the whole apple. Record removed quantity exactly once: original quantity equals remaining apple plus actual swallowed portion plus any explicitly modeled retained preparation outputs or losses; create no stock. Actual nutrition and adverse effects come solely from the validated consumption/response code, never from declared safety, expectations or mood. An actual bite is irreversible; cancellation or death cannot refund swallowed food or paid work. Before an atomic assessment or bite commit, interruption/cancellation/death produces no charge, consumption or completion record. Completed assessment costs are not refunded. Any genuinely multi-step trial must persist paid progress, exact portions, locks and scheduled effects; pause before unpaid work on lost prerequisites, resume without resetting dose or cooldown, release locks once on cancellation/death at actual locations, and retain already incurred physiological effects. Stop further doses on refusal, cancellation, loss of prerequisites, an adverse represented event or expiry of the quoted authorization; stopping cannot erase delayed effects already caused. No automatic repeat doses. No passive assessment, free recovery, maintenance benefit or automatic report refresh. Any observation period advances only through actual world actions and records supported observable changes; absence of a symptom during a bounded period is not general safety certification. Review and development waiting advance no world time. No other participant's actions, communication or consent are supplied.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Assessment, quotes, request, registration and study grant no pleasure, curiosity, satisfaction, comfort or nutrition. The color/evidence-limit precursor grants zero experience, including repeated reports. A later physically executed trial may record new verified personally relevant information, including informative failure, but only invoke an already implemented applicable experience rule with its existing amount, cap, decay and cooldown. If no such rule is available, award zero rather than create a reward account. Canonical source/specimen-property-state deduplication must span equivalent abilities and exclude report IDs and timestamps. Unchanged observations and mere lack of modeled effects are not new discoveries. Legitimate familiar practice or social participation may qualify only through an applicable established rule and real events, not automatic completion credit. Basic nutrition is independent of mood; physical comfort cannot exceed 10. Do not alter protected accounts, budgets, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Use reusable versioned event metadata containing actor, specimen ID, origin, actual location, method, timestamp, observed-state fingerprint, evidence scope and status. Only a committed assessment emits assessment-completed and a private findings view; unavailable traits remain visibly unknown, without a safe-food badge or invented interior rendering. Quote availability is an interface status, not a physical success animation. Only an independently authorized committed ingestion emits a consumed-portion event and updates the actual remaining quantity. Subsequent represented physiological events must cite that consumption event and actual supported observations, not display an inferred health benefit or safety result. Rejected, interrupted, unsupported and cancelled operations display their true status and never show ingestion, completion or nutrition success. Findings remain personal unless Moss actually communicates them through an existing interface.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"98b882b7-f39a-4884-95a9-d0b563083a7f","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["sect